  "readmeFile": "PackageReadme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.2.0 — BREAKING: API realineada (fiel) al MPS.SharedKernel original. Outbox rico (OutboxMessage con EventId/EventType/retry/permanent-fail, EfOutboxStore con FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED + IAsyncDisposable, OutboxRedispatchHostedService con backoff + deserialización por type name, OutboxPurgeHostedService, OutboxHealthCheck multi-store). DomainEventDispatchInterceptor persiste eventos al outbox en la misma transacción. ScopedQueryHandler/ScopedCommandHandler (ctor IServiceScopeFactory, ExecuteAsync(query,db,sp,ct) → Result<T>). DI: AddDomainEventDispatcher, AddOutboxRedispatchService(IConfiguration), AddModuleOutbox<T>(moduleName), AddDomainEventHandlersFromAssembly. 0.1.0 — initial simplified release.",
